# Build output
# A built theme zip is a deploy artifact, never source. `shilo-pro-theme.zip` was
# ignored by exact name, so its successor `shilo-v8-theme.zip` was committed by
# omission — 413 KB of duplicated theme/, at the most discoverable path in the
# repo, carrying a config/settings_data.json that had none of the importer-seal
# uploads the owner made in the theme editor. Anyone importing it as a new theme
# would have silently dropped the Makita and Milwaukee official-importer badges.
# Glob it, so the next name is covered too.
*-theme.zip
*.tgz

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

